{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-6","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：棱锥与多边形","englishTitle":"Pyramids which are of the same height and have polygonal bases are to one another as the bases.","book":12,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.6/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","contentId":"euclid-12-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9022a2de7b96188bf7bfce6885a32207a4b8224a1969edc64dd9a9fa7f673e66","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-6.statement","euclid-12-6.construction.1","euclid-12-6.construction.2","euclid-12-6.proof.1","euclid-12-6.proof.2","euclid-12-6.proof.3","euclid-12-6.proof.4","euclid-12-6.proof.5","euclid-12-6.proof.6","euclid-12-6.proof.7","euclid-12-6.proof.8","euclid-12-6.proof.9","euclid-12-6.proof.10","euclid-12-6.conclusion","euclid-12-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"727f1d2b8c04b59a1a164a4d0d83c9d8fea6551e41b2dff4e6e82e5ad099ee49","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Pyramids which are of the same height and have polygonal bases are to one another as the bases."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"身高相同、具有多边形底边的金字塔与底边是相互的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e7bdd7029fba13f0f3bf79992e1cc354afbc27d6c78dda56d0eaca343205e9b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be pyramids of the same height of which the polygons ABCDE, FGHKL are the bases and the points M, N the vertices; I say that, as the base ABCDE is to the base FGHKL, so is the pyramid ABCDEM to the pyramid FGHKLN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"允许有同样高的金字塔,其中多边形 ABCDE,FGHKL是底边,M点是顶峰;我说,底边 ABCDE对底边 FGHKL的比例等于金字塔ABCDEM与金字塔FGHKLN的比例"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2192a8e28b1361e6570699b7b9b42ed227b5cf2e87a45252278d445c06f52b17","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AC, AD, FH, FK be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC,AD,FH,FK连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4fe131abc1f5b48fdf40da1e6e6bada6b53107390ad85ac0db120d470fd180c","citations":["euclid-12-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then ABCM, ACDM are two pyramids which have triangular bases and equal height, they are to one another as the bases; [[XII. 5](/principles/euclid-12-5)] therefore, as the base ABC is to the base ACD, so is the pyramid ABCM to the pyramid ACDM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那以后,ACDM金字塔是两个金字塔,三角底边和等高,彼此为底边;因此,底边 ABC和底边 ACD的比等于金字塔ABCM与金字塔ACDM的比 [[XII. 5](/principles/euclid-12-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77bdc6d13b092394a6cd7a917419360deef741d4e85d09d603cc1a99e7fac826","citations":["euclid-5-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, componendo, as the base ABCD is to the base ACD, so is the pyramid ABCDM to the pyramid ACDM. [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"和, 兼容,底边 ABCD对底边 ACD的比 等于金字塔ABCDM对金字塔ACDM的比 [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"92dab460a9dd2608d8f77f8498f12376ba8f340e8b05f01f1f5bfa7b67d6ec8f","citations":["euclid-12-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But also, as the base ACD is to the base ADE, so is the pyramid ACDM to the pyramid ADEM. [[XII. 5](/principles/euclid-12-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ACD比底边比ADE 等于ACDM比ADEM [[XII. 5](/principles/euclid-12-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad82913c850f666d9ae58197a9395bb4582484346dedbe38ec885a99a4e9cfd7","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, ex aequali, as the base ABCD is to the base ADE, so is the pyramid ABCDM to the pyramid ADEM. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从平等角度看,底边 ABCD对底边 ADE的比等于金字塔ABCDM对金字塔ADEM的比 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b55d4cf0be65c5c4fbad0a31f76bc0fb98bfc12838f0ba4f5a5b1aafbdcdc46f","citations":["euclid-5-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And again componendo, as the base ABCDE is to the base ADE, so is the pyramid ABCDEM to the pyramid ADEM. [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"再一次,底边 ABCDE对底边 ADE的比等于金字塔ABCDEM对金字塔ADEM的比 [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7ef3eee0ff02f104149ac8397e94de49efb10542a8f1f015a1888f1901b7b42","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly also it can be proved that, as the base FGHKL is to the base FGH, so is the pyramid FGHKLN to the pyramid FGHN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,底边 FGHKL对底边 FGH的比也与金字塔FGHKLN对金字塔FGHN的比相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad5b7365ff2f7e19cf9d39d8963a9a28184a3e86e914bbcc843e6cb80a39fdb0","citations":["euclid-12-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since ADEM, FGHN are two pyramids which have triangular bases and equal height, therefore, as the base ADE is to the base FGH, so is the pyramid ADEM to the pyramid FGHN. [[XII. 5](/principles/euclid-12-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自ADEM以来,FGHN是两个金字塔, 三角底边和等高, 因此,底边 ADE和底边 FGH的比等于金字塔ADEM和金字塔FGHN的比 [[XII. 5](/principles/euclid-12-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"edd0440803622534b5e5086037080f2b123ee79ba3734c947bf10a7773309ceb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the base ADE is to the base ABCDE, so was the pyramid ADEM to the pyramid ABCDEM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,底边 ADE是底边 ABCDE, ADEM是金字塔ABCDEM"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10a4cf6603aa727f759716fd6c8b4a5578f4a34e55b698b8a430aa3bd4ccf169","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, ex aequali, as the base ABCDE is to the base FGH, so is the pyramid ABCDEM to the pyramid FGHN. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平等方面,底边 ABCDE对底边 FGH的比相当于金字塔ABCDEM对金字塔FGHN的比 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66702189783b623cf76f5b7f9b931af46b88441a767886be8c010b70411dd2b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But further, as the base FGH is to the base FGHKL, so also was the pyramid FGHN to the pyramid FGHKLN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"更进一步,底边 FGH是底边 FGHKL, FGHN是金字塔,FGHKLN也是"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a6dd01c690d6f8b279d9c1c1a2b15636aae891762cf277119b579664e794071","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, ex aequali, as the base ABCDE is to the base FGHKL, so is the pyramid ABCDEM to the pyramid FGHKLN. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平等方面,底边 ABCDE对底边 FGHKL的比相当于金字塔ABCDEM对金字塔FGHKLNQ. E.D的比 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-6.source","contentId":"euclid-12-6","revisionId":"euclid-12-6@raw-9022a2de7b96188b","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37e043c3c99910f46a81807189a7708765e1bd82b16c05101e6890f901fad8e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-6:euclid-12-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-6.proof.1","euclid-12-6.proof.3","euclid-12-6.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-5","type":"depends_on","p